(1180, '', 26, 'iso_basic', 'memo1', '---', NULL, ' Περιγραφή Θέσης\nAntaeus Travel Group is looking for a Full Stack Developer to build and implement a functional web application. The successful candidate will work with other developers throughout the development life cycle. In this role, you should be a team player with a keen eye for detail and problem-solving skills. If you also have experience in API development and popular coding languages (e.g. JavaScript), we’d like to meet you. Type of work: Full- time in house', NULL, NULL, '2022-02-22 09:56:43', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, NULL, 0, NULL),
